    {
      "id": "2122861099376623696",
      "text": "#Isles Matthew Schaefer is playing in his 102nd NHL game. He has 30 goals and 51 assists (81 points). This season he has seven goals, 15 assists (22 points) midway through the second period of his 20th game.",
      "url": "https://x.com/AGrossNewsday/status/2122861099376623696",
      "published": "2026-11-18T01:15:01+00:00",
      "likes": 23,
      "author": "Andrew Gross",
      "handle": "AGrossNewsday",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/364012061/n1042077731_9886_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122860691379945827",
      "text": "Just to put into perspective what Matthew Schaefer is doing: He's just the 16th defenseman in #Isles history to score 30 goals. He is 19 years old.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JoePantorno/status/2122860691379945827",
      "published": "2026-11-18T01:13:24+00:00",
      "likes": 13,
      "author": "Joe Pantorno",
      "handle": "JoePantorno",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1851627200304365568/J5M-ZEup_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122859759590125655",
      "text": "Matthew Schaefer makes history. That goal was the 30th of his career, joining Phil Housley (46) as the only two defensemen in #NHL history to reach that mark as teenagers.",
      "url": "https://x.com/stefen_rosner/status/2122859759590125655",
      "published": "2026-11-18T01:09:42+00:00",
      "likes": 269,
      "author": "Stefen Rosner",
      "handle": "stefen_rosner",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2107797565768876032/Mb8HQ_H3_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122859701792809396",
      "text": "That was Matthew Schaefer's 30th career goal, just the second teenager in #Isles history to hit that mark.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JoePantorno/status/2122859701792809396",
      "published": "2026-11-18T01:09:28+00:00",
